<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-002" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:willow" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:willow:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">桓公</persName>北征經金城，見前爲琅邪時種柳，皆已十圍，慨然曰：「木猶如此，人何以堪！」攀枝執條，泫然流涙。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:ancestry" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:ancestry:m0000" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">温</persName>字<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:ancestry:m0002" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_AA">元子</persName>，譙國龍亢人，漢五更<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:ancestry:m0014" ref="l32_kr9_ok2">桓榮</persName>後也。父<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-002-jin098-huanwen-luoyang:ancestry:m0020" ref="u9s_w6j_8mc_A">彝</persName>，有識鑒。</p>
</text>
